#basePath Chapter12

::OnContractSelectOpenCh12
@trigger 
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Arken}    Alirghty Locke, you ready to be rid of this debt?
{@Player}   I'm ready to be rid of Frontier. 
{@Arken}    Well some good news then, those diamond wafers are ready. 
{@Player}   Let's get this done. 
{@Arken}    Let's. 

::AfterResearchCh12

@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}   Hey Taryn. 
{@Taryn}    Locke! 
{@Taryn}    Arken told me you might be sourcing some diamond wafers from Blair.
{@Player}   Yay, I wanted to-
//conference call dial. 
{@Ovill}    Locke, hey. 
{@Player}   Oh, uh Ovill-
{@Ovill}    I'm going to keep it short and sweet. I've... been let go. 
{@Ovill}    Profits are in the gutter and so the chopping block is out. 
{@Ovill}    I'll be replaced by a bot effective immediately.
{@Taryn}    They fired you Ovill?
{@Ovill}    Taryn?!
{@Ovill}    I didn't realize, I should... go.
{@Taryn}    Wait, Ovill. 
{@Taryn}    Kalvis is always looking for more representatives.
{@Taryn}    We could use someone like you on the team. 
{@Ovill}    Wait... really?  
{@Taryn}    We can be deserters together. 
{@Ovill}    ...I'll... I'll book a shuttle to Kalvis. Thank you...
{@Taryn}    See you soon Ovill.  
    


::AfterSupplyChain12
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

{@Xavier}	Locke. 
{@Player} 	Hey, you actually got my name right this time. 
{@Xavier} 	Yea, yea.
{@Xavier}   Heard you and the new CEO got into a scuffle. 
{@Player}   How do you know?
{@Xavier}   He told me himself. 
{@Xavier}   You don't come back home to Ralston with a black eye expecting no-one questioning you. 
{@Xavier}   Anyways... 
{@Xavier}   Good work, pawn. Seems you reached the other end of the board. 
{@Player}   It feels like things are just get started...
{@Xavier}   And they are. So be ready, Locke.
{@Xavier}   Friends in high places, so remember me Locke. Business is always open for you. 
{@Player}   Won't you get in trouble if you work with me?
{@Xavier}   Oh please Locke, you doubt me. 
{@Xavier}   Ralston's got a shiny image, but we all know it's all fool's gold underneath. 
{@Xavier}   How do you think it got so rich? 
{@Player}   Fair point...

::AfterFabrication12 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@Arken}    Well Locke, this is it. 
{@Player}   It's unreal...
{@Player}   Thought I would never pay off this debt. 
{@Arken}    But you are. That means something Locke. 
{@Player}   Thanks to you, and everyone else whose got me here.
{@Callie}   Aye, I know, I really carried the team didn't I? 
{@Player}   You've only been working for a cycle...
{@Callie}   And what back-breaking work I've been putting in! 
{@Quinn}    Just press the button already! I need a full pay-check. 
{@Joel}     Quinnie... 
{@Quinn}    Right... sorry Cap'
{@Arken}    Whenever you're ready Captain. 
